{"w":2400,"h":3395,"lines":[{"y":0.10895170805213716,"w":0.053497943878173831,"c":1,"h":0.011778563015312216,"x":0.21193415553004893,"t":"Test 3"},{"x":0.24262612280052737,"h":0.020348311874695102,"c":1,"t":"From the tiny proportion of insects that have been investigated, several promising","y":0.14817302768596707,"w":0.68141667683919271},{"x":0.2529101570813384,"h":0.020705228699952616,"t":"compounds have been identified. For example, alloferon, an antimicrobial","y":0.16305590184251095,"w":0.60730539957682295,"c":1},{"t":"compound produced by blow fly larvae, is used as an antiviral and antitumor agent","c":1,"w":0.68106994628906248,"h":0.01453659587810685,"y":0.18168433448037791,"x":0.25308642582068841},{"y":0.1942278346126145,"t":"in South Korea and Russia. The larvae of a few other insect species are being","w":0.64439203898111974,"x":0.25085294695581356,"h":0.018064324791215114,"c":1},{"h":0.018894698791144471,"c":1,"y":0.20948752587946018,"x":0.25086056131273571,"t":"investigated for the potent antimicrobial compounds they produce. Meanwhile, a","w":0.66288238525390619},{"x":0.25296379723038248,"w":0.6504470316569011,"t":"compound from the venom of the wasp Polybia paulista has potential in cancer","h":0.01751649786923315,"y":0.22614300223297934,"c":1},{"w":0.086419754028320278,"y":0.2427325580052101,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"treatment.","x":0.24897119283916899,"c":1},{"y":0.26560024685505135,"w":0.64838150024414065,"h":0.01927792309872256,"t":"Why is it that insects have received relatively little attention in bioprospecting?","x":0.24472641216821139,"c":1},{"t":"Firstly, there are so many insects that, without some manner of targeted approach,","c":1,"w":0.68131693522135417,"x":0.25090659667556431,"h":0.017785445259372756,"y":0.28167237672174095},{"c":1,"x":0.25092979208421412,"w":0.67095845540364585,"t":"investigating this huge variety of species is a daunting task. Secondly, insects are","y":0.29693822433575057,"h":0.016470093609166181},{"w":0.64837453206380202,"c":1,"y":0.3121631286301273,"t":"generally very small, and the glands inside them that secrete potentially useful","x":0.24884846622892573,"h":0.018526276093068561},{"t":"compounds are smaller still. This can make it difficult to obtain sufficient quantities","w":0.67731948852539059,"h":0.020874989468020688,"x":0.24879452796371046,"y":0.32567774240783121,"c":1},{"h":0.018279129540541117,"t":"of the compound for subsequent testing. Thirdly, although we consider insects to be","c":1,"x":0.2489016567997199,"y":0.34297063184117249,"w":0.68944320678710946},{"h":0.018042367816111793,"y":0.35867533749686187,"x":0.24889624585956918,"w":0.68327784220377608,"c":1,"t":"everywhere, the reality of this ubiquity is vast numbers of a few extremely common"},{"c":1,"t":"species. Many insect species are infrequently encountered and very difficult to rear","y":0.37366291313386679,"h":0.018836893659036735,"x":0.24885016507445301,"w":0.68541188557942712},{"t":"in captivity, which, again, can leave us with insufficient material to work with.","h":0.021538836655543792,"x":0.2487465196808849,"y":0.38908668051230655,"w":0.6279950459798177,"c":1},{"w":0.62551442464192708,"h":0.015988372380376759,"x":0.24691356940764914,"t":"My colleagues and I at Aberystwyth University in the UK have developed an","c":1,"y":0.41424418589860512},{"y":0.42894297887238109,"w":0.6298707071940105,"c":1,"t":"approach in which we use our knowledge of ecology as a guide to target our","h":0.018823340587818205,"x":0.24884213532491287},{"t":"efforts. The creatures that particularly interest us are the many insects that secrete","x":0.24678614569000124,"w":0.68131881713867182,"y":0.44436971880965803,"h":0.018800984844302038,"c":1},{"x":0.24676899844921232,"y":0.45885461636535441,"w":0.64643142700195311,"h":0.020718914881190598,"c":1,"t":"powerful poison for subduing prey and keeping it fresh for future consumption."},{"h":0.020287054306767138,"c":1,"x":0.2467652728144005,"t":"There are even more insects that are masters of exploiting filthy habitats, such as","w":0.67310679117838534,"y":0.47437490230313939},{"c":1,"t":"faeces and carcasses, where they are regularly challenged by thousands of micro-","x":0.24478567177317737,"y":0.49124982056419542,"h":0.017900291123856382,"w":0.68325932820638025},{"x":0.24677546851285523,"h":0.019945409750067866,"t":"organisms. These insects have many antimicrobial compounds for dealing with","y":0.50547452845944274,"w":0.65047744750976566,"c":1},{"t":"pathogenic bacteria and fungi, suggesting that there is certainly potential to find","w":0.65456914265950528,"x":0.24678989498786147,"h":0.019012511829605394,"y":0.52097959631159696,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.24897120052911684,"h":0.013250883392226132,"t":"many compounds that can serve as or inspire new antibiotics.","w":0.50823043823242187,"y":0.539163721761863},{"y":0.56087906472872995,"w":0.64427246093750001,"c":1,"h":0.018042738502241917,"t":"Although natural history knowledge points us in the right direction, it doesn't","x":0.22620944396370135},{"t":"solve the problems associated with obtaining useful compounds from insects.","h":0.017363417977017459,"w":0.63805074055989597,"c":1,"y":0.57662880614230738,"x":0.24682132863281736},{"y":0.59119484120578281,"w":0.65042663574218751,"x":0.2447382238829463,"c":1,"t":"Fortunately, it is now possible to snip out the stretches of the insect's DNA that","h":0.018176010275617216},{"w":0.6628023783365885,"x":0.24473103253650816,"h":0.018861903178256645,"t":"carry the codes for the interesting compounds and insert them into cell lines that","y":0.60679857070042109,"c":1},{"h":0.019485109686430246,"c":1,"x":0.2447339538206838,"t":"allow larger quantities to be produced. And although the road from isolating and","y":0.62177029993141786,"w":0.65662322998046885},{"w":0.64432871500651034,"y":0.63674579215862581,"h":0.019701873455788999,"c":1,"x":0.24470061344236835,"t":"characterising compounds with desirable qualities to developing a commercial"},{"y":0.65285540040720724,"t":"product is very long and full of pitfalls, the variety of successful animal-derived","w":0.64221059163411442,"x":0.24474330262723973,"c":1,"h":0.018845235220254275},{"x":0.24472635619411884,"w":0.64018925984700514,"h":0.019261261318822442,"y":0.66793723721113396,"t":"pharmaceuticals on the market demonstrates there is a precedent here that is","c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.13453203837076824,"x":0.24654358562257292,"y":0.68362757709813249,"h":0.015365658997085196,"t":"worth exploring."},{"w":0.6442473856608073,"t":"With every bit of wilderness that disappears, we deprive ourselves of potential","h":0.01884716110319351,"y":0.70777246646073022,"c":1,"x":0.24267847997672276},{"y":0.72452909823824208,"h":0.014800284018364862,"c":1,"x":0.24685295821766773,"t":"medicines. As much as l'd love to help develop a groundbreaking insect-derived","w":0.65445078531901035},{"w":0.65843622843424476,"h":0.016195524146054185,"y":0.73969375739237153,"c":1,"t":"medicine, my main motivation for looking at insects in this way is conservation. I","x":0.24485595954072911},{"w":0.67301574707031253,"t":"sincerely believe that all species, however small and seemingly insignificant, have","x":0.24476555678273618,"y":0.75515517461511106,"h":0.017998698181763473,"c":1},{"h":0.016324861029994531,"w":0.650376180013021,"t":"a right to exist for their own sake. If we can shine a light on the darker recesses","x":0.24477144600923631,"y":0.77009437207707654,"c":1},{"w":0.65048238118489576,"h":0.019346729184207989,"x":0.24267631494973216,"c":1,"y":0.78401688292373617,"t":"of nature's medicine cabinet, exploring the useful chemistry of the most diverse"},{"c":1,"x":0.24270236633707365,"y":0.80037181339275121,"w":0.64628351847330734,"t":"animals on the planet, I believe we can make people think differently about the","h":0.018307400536059726},{"y":0.81518310941898686,"w":0.13254369099934896,"x":0.24449795272969069,"c":1,"t":"value of nature.","h":0.015062598373359104},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"x":0.20164609005068973,"y":0.86337209283207861,"t":"64","w":0.026748971939086902}]}